## Shop › Checkout

### Checkout with every UI step

| Priority | Tags | Steps |
|---|---|---|
| P1 | #smoke #checkout flow | 63 |

Covers the whole UI catalogue.

**Preconditions:** A product is in stock.

**Steps**

1. Do “Sign in as admin”:
   - Open /login
   - Type "{{data.user}}" into the "Email" field
   - Type "{{secret.adminPassword}}" into the field with placeholder "Password"
   - Click the "Sign in" button
2. Run the scenario “Open the cart”:
   - Open /cart
3. ✔ Open {{env.baseUrl}}/products?region={{env.region}}
4. ✔ Click the element "product-1"
5. Double-click "Zoom image"
6. Right-click the element ".gallery img"
7. Hover over the "Details" link
8. Type "blue {{data.qty}}" into the "Search" field
9. Clear the "Search" field
10. ✔ Type "{{data.qty}}" into the element "qty"
11. Press Enter in the element "qty"
12. Press Control+A
13. Select "express" in the "Shipping" field
14. Select "Gift wrap" in the "Extras" field
15. Select "2" in the "Country" field
16. Tick the "I agree" checkbox
17. Untick the "Newsletter" checkbox
18. Upload fixtures/invoice.pdf to the "Attachment" field
19. Drag the element "item-a" onto the element "basket"
20. Scroll down the page
21. Scroll to the element "footer"
22. Accept the next dialog
23. Click the element "//button[@id='remove']"
24. Dismiss the next dialog
25. Switch into the frame "iframe#checkout", then "iframe#payment"
26. Type "4242 4242 4242 4242" into the field with placeholder "Card number"
27. Return to the main page
28. Click the "Terms" link
29. Switch to the new tab
30. Wait for the page to load
31. Close the current tab
32. Switch to the new tab
33. Wait until the element "spinner" is hidden
34. Wait for the URL **/checkout/*
35. Take a screenshot of the page — Order summary
36. Take a screenshot of the element "total" — Total box
37. Read the text of the element "total" (save as total)
38. Read the attribute of the "Invoice" link (save as invoiceUrl)
39. Read the count of the element ".line-item" (save as lines)
40. Read the url of the page (save as here)
41. ✔ Check that the "Order confirmed" heading is visible
42. ✔ Check that the element "error" is hidden
43. ✔ Check that the element "greeting" reads "Thank you, {{data.user}}!"
44. ✔ Check that the element "total" contains "{{vars.total}}"
45. ✔ Check that the element "order-id" matches /^ORD-\d{6}$/
46. ✔ Check that the "Shipping" field has the value "express"
47. ✔ Check that there are 2 × the element ".line-item"
48. ✔ Check an attribute of the element "cart" equals "false"
49. ✔ Check that the "Pay" button is enabled
50. ✔ Check that the "Undo" button is disabled
51. ✔ Check that the "I agree" checkbox is checked
52. ✔ Check that the "Newsletter" checkbox is not checked
53. ✔ Check that the URL is "/orders/done"
54. ✔ Check that the URL contains "done"
55. ✔ Check that the page title is "Order confirmed"
56. ✔ Check that the page title contains "confirmed"
57. ✔ Click the element "receipt"
58. Check that the page looks like the approved screenshot — Receipt looks right

