## Shop › Browser

### Network, storage and clock

| Priority | Tags | Steps |
|---|---|---|
| P2 | #browser | 33 |

**Steps**

1. Set the page clock to 2026-03-01T09:00:00Z (running)
2. Answer requests to **/api/stock* with 200
3. Make requests to /api/ads fail
4. Slow down requests to /api/slow by 500 ms
5. Answer requests to /api/banner with 503
6. Open /products
7. ✔ Wait for the GET response from /api/products (save as products)
8. Stop faking **/api/stock*
9. Tap the "Menu" button
10. ✔ Download the file from the "Export CSV" link (save as csv)
11. Set the cookie "consent" to "yes"
12. ✔ Read the cookie "consent"
13. Remove the cookie "consent"
14. Set the local storage "cart" to "[object Object]"
15. ✔ Read the local storage "cart" (save as cart)
16. Clear session storage
17. Clear all cookies
18. Go offline
19. ✔ Check that "You are offline" is visible
20. Go back online
21. Move the clock forward 300000 ms
22. Set the page clock to 1772355600000
23. If the "Accept cookies" button is visible
   - Click the "Accept cookies" button
   - Otherwise:
      - Note: No cookie banner
24. Repeat while the "Load more" button is enabled — Load every page
   - Click the "Load more" button
25. If there are 12 × the element ".product-card"
   - Note: A full page
26. If the element "status" contains "{{vars.csv.fileName}}"
   - Note: Status names the file
27. ✔ Check the network traffic of this page (save as traffic)

